      "ordinal": 269,
      "start_ms": 631800,
      "end_ms": 635340,
      "text": "是记录那个记录"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 270,
      "start_ms": 635340,
      "end_ms": 638819,
      "text": "记录就是记录这个公益活动的那个成本的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 271,
      "start_ms": 638819,
      "end_ms": 640319,
      "text": "就他也是食材啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 272,
      "start_ms": 640319,
      "end_ms": 641099,
      "text": "他吃的我操"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 273,
      "start_ms": 641099,
      "end_ms": 643139,
      "text": "你不能入饺子是白送的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 274,
      "start_ms": 643139,
      "end_ms": 643919,
      "text": "不可能的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 275,
      "start_ms": 643919,
      "end_ms": 647639,
      "text": "进入那个我从勋章当中赚到的钱"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 276,
      "start_ms": 647639,
      "end_ms": 650060,
      "text": "然后我来自己"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 277,
      "start_ms": 650500,
      "end_ms": 651880,
      "text": "你可以说我做大善人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 278,
      "start_ms": 651880,
      "end_ms": 654910,
      "text": "我再也不是我来捐到这个"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 279,
      "start_ms": 654910,
      "end_ms": 658180,
      "text": "这个你相当于你甚至可以说"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 280,
      "start_ms": 658180,
      "end_ms": 659920,
      "text": "如果非要去定义这个活动的话"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 281,
      "start_ms": 659920,
      "end_ms": 660760,
      "text": "商业上定义的话"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 282,
      "start_ms": 660760,
      "end_ms": 664240,
      "text": "就是这个店的营销活动啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 283,
      "start_ms": 665920,
      "end_ms": 666880,
      "text": "他是记录的啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 284,
      "start_ms": 666880,
      "end_ms": 671520,
      "text": "记录这个因为这是吃进肚子里面的啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 285,
      "start_ms": 671520,
      "end_ms": 676240,
      "text": "而且这个饺子的这个这个选择了这个平台"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 286,
      "start_ms": 676240,
      "end_ms": 678760,
      "text": "选择就极大的降低了它的门槛"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 287,
      "start_ms": 679060,
      "end_ms": 681130,
      "text": "极大降低门槛啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 288,
      "start_ms": 681130,
      "end_ms": 687000,
      "text": "而且它会成为一个meme啊me好"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 289,
      "start_ms": 687000,
      "end_ms": 691040,
      "text": "我们会在本周本周啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 290,
      "start_ms": 691040,
      "end_ms": 692300,
      "text": "我们在这个星期"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 291,
      "start_ms": 692300,
      "end_ms": 695780,
      "text": "本周六其实就是平安夜是吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 292,
      "start_ms": 703940,
      "end_ms": 707680,
      "text": "那个所谓的这个西方圣诞节"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 293,
      "start_ms": 707680,
      "end_ms": 709060,
      "text": "义上的那种平安夜啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 294,
      "start_ms": 709060,
      "end_ms": 712930,
      "text": "基督教传统当中的啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 295,
      "start_ms": 712930,
      "end_ms": 714520,
      "text": "我我个人当然是不胜论者"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 296,
      "start_ms": 714520,
      "end_ms": 715319,
      "text": "不信教啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 297,
      "start_ms": 715500,
      "end_ms": 718500,
      "text": "只是说援引一个很很多文化里面"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 298,
      "start_ms": 718500,
      "end_ms": 720210,
      "text": "对他的一个一个命名了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 299,
      "start_ms": 720210,
      "end_ms": 721140,
      "text": "12月24号"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 300,
      "start_ms": 721140,
      "end_ms": 722180,
      "text": "我们好"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 301,
      "start_ms": 722180,
      "end_ms": 722960,
      "text": "我们就得核反"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 302,
      "start_ms": 722960,
      "end_ms": 723830,
      "text": "是限量供应"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 303,
      "start_ms": 723830,
      "end_ms": 726920,
      "text": "但是呢饺子啊是挺直"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 304,
      "start_ms": 726920,
      "end_ms": 727520,
      "text": "饺子"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 305,
      "start_ms": 727520,
      "end_ms": 729110,
      "text": "我们敞开了吃好吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 306,
      "start_ms": 729110,
      "end_ms": 730820,
      "text": "这个水饺我们敞开来吃"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 307,
      "start_ms": 730820,
      "end_ms": 731960,
      "text": "但是有个潜艇"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 308,
      "start_ms": 731960,
      "end_ms": 733400,
      "text": "这是劳动群众啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 309,
      "start_ms": 733400,
      "end_ms": 734620,
      "text": "劳动群众"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 310,
      "start_ms": 734880,
      "end_ms": 736140,
      "text": "你是小老板"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 311,
      "start_ms": 736140,
      "end_ms": 736740,
      "text": "小自然业绩"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 312,
      "start_ms": 736740,
      "end_ms": 737760,
      "text": "这个东西不欢迎啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 313,
      "start_ms": 737760,
      "end_ms": 738570,
      "text": "不允许进来"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 314,
      "start_ms": 738570,
      "end_ms": 739800,
      "text": "不欢迎不欢迎"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 315,
      "start_ms": 739800,
      "end_ms": 742140,
      "text": "你好吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 316,
      "start_ms": 747540,
      "end_ms": 750200,
      "text": "好我觉得这个是挺得得天独厚的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 317,
      "start_ms": 750200,
      "end_ms": 751280,
      "text": "挺挺得天独厚的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 318,
      "start_ms": 751280,
      "end_ms": 753520,
      "text": "而且你饺子里面"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 319,
      "start_ms": 753520,
      "end_ms": 756100,
      "text": "就所以说我们最后援引一个一个画"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 320,
      "start_ms": 756100,
      "end_ms": 760180,
      "text": "就是说这个所谓的邪不压正里面的嗯"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 321,
      "start_ms": 760180,
      "end_ms": 762160,
      "text": "那个姜文说的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 322,
      "start_ms": 762160,
      "end_ms": 765910,
      "text": "就是说就是说我是为了这碟醋才包了这顿饺子"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 323,
      "start_ms": 765910,
      "end_ms": 769780,
      "text": "为了这碟醋底下怎么写"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 324,
      "start_ms": 771540,
      "end_ms": 773360,
      "text": "哎呀不碟仙的碟"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 325,
      "start_ms": 773360,
      "end_ms": 776240,
      "text": "我是为了这碟醋醋怎么写"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 326,
      "start_ms": 776240,
      "end_ms": 778680,
      "text": "有字旁啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 327,
      "start_ms": 778680,
      "end_ms": 780900,
      "text": "才包了才包了这顿饺子"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 328,
      "start_ms": 784100,
      "end_ms": 785180,
      "text": "饺子"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 329,
      "start_ms": 787720,
      "end_ms": 790320,
      "text": "但这我这点醋是什么呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 330,
      "start_ms": 790320,
      "end_ms": 793500,
      "text": "我觉得这点醋我们出了这个啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 331,
      "start_ms": 793500,
      "end_ms": 795720,
      "text": "我们要吃出主人翁的地位"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 332,
      "start_ms": 795720,
      "end_ms": 799250,
      "text": "我们要吃出这个啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 333,
      "start_ms": 802500,
      "end_ms": 803580,
      "text": "制度的优越性啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 334,
      "start_ms": 808890,
      "end_ms": 810990,
      "text": "去追求的工工工人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 335,
      "start_ms": 810990,
      "end_ms": 813560,
      "text": "工农大众的啊利益啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 336,
      "start_ms": 813560,
      "end_ms": 816319,
      "text": "切身的利益以及长远的根本的利益啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 337,
      "start_ms": 817140,
      "end_ms": 821280,
      "text": "你妈说这些话哈哈我自己就有点呃"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 338,
      "start_ms": 821280,
      "end_ms": 822300,
      "text": "我实事求是讲啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 339,
      "start_ms": 822300,
      "end_ms": 824820,
      "text": "就是说这个东西我主要是看中它的可复制性"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 340,
      "start_ms": 824820,
      "end_ms": 828400,
      "text": "它有极强的可复制性呃"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 341,
      "start_ms": 828400,
      "end_ms": 829720,
      "text": "他有很强的可复制性"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 342,
      "start_ms": 829720,
      "end_ms": 831130,
      "text": "很强的可复自信"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 343,
      "start_ms": 831130,
      "end_ms": 834100,
      "text": "你们你们再也不要以任何理由来推脱"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 344,
      "start_ms": 834100,
      "end_ms": 836380,
      "text": "说你们包饺子不会有个面皮"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 345,
      "start_ms": 836380,
      "end_ms": 838639,
      "text": "我上面加点肉馅吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 346,
      "start_ms": 838639,
      "end_ms": 840339,
      "text": "多多吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 347,
      "start_ms": 840620,
      "end_ms": 842180,
      "text": "只要剁就行了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 348,
      "start_ms": 842180,
      "end_ms": 843800,
      "text": "把它剁碎就可以了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 349,
      "start_ms": 843800,
      "end_ms": 847760,
      "text": "然后把这个线往里面放一包褶子"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 350,
      "start_ms": 847760,
      "end_ms": 849260,
      "text": "捏几个都沾点口"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 351,
      "start_ms": 849260,
      "end_ms": 849920,
      "text": "不沾点"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 352,
      "start_ms": 849920,
      "end_ms": 850700,
      "text": "沾点清水"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 353,
      "start_ms": 850700,
      "end_ms": 851540,
      "text": "肘子包几个"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 354,
      "start_ms": 851540,
      "end_ms": 852080,
      "text": "你自己吃"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 355,
      "start_ms": 852080,
      "end_ms": 853550,
      "text": "蘸口水没事"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 356,
      "start_ms": 853550,
      "end_ms": 858780,
      "text": "但是说你要叫边吃走着粘粘上下锅一煮"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 357,
      "start_ms": 858780,
      "end_ms": 860160,
      "text": "煮的汤汤放下浮动啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 358,
      "start_ms": 860160,
      "end_ms": 861060,
      "text": "捞出来吃掉"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 359,
      "start_ms": 861060,
      "end_ms": 862380,
      "text": "好蘸点醋啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 360,
      "start_ms": 862380,
      "end_ms": 863850,
      "text": "没有技术含量的朋友"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 361,
      "start_ms": 863850,
      "end_ms": 865140,
      "text": "包饺子都不会焦"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 362,
      "start_ms": 865140,
      "end_ms": 866200,
      "text": "都不会包"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 363,
      "start_ms": 866200,
      "end_ms": 867430,
      "text": "你搞什么啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 364,
      "start_ms": 867430,
      "end_ms": 869960,
      "text": "还还追求工艺呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 365,
      "start_ms": 869960,
      "end_ms": 871490,
      "text": "我靠工人的工啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 366,
      "start_ms": 871490,
      "end_ms": 873740,
      "text": "所以具有很强的可复制性"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 367,
      "start_ms": 873740,
      "end_ms": 875380,
      "text": "非常强的可复制性啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 368,
      "start_ms": 876040,
      "end_ms": 879900,
      "text": "然后嗯它的营养也相对比较全面"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 369,
      "start_ms": 879900,
      "end_ms": 880980,
      "text": "营养比较全面"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 370,
      "start_ms": 880980,
      "end_ms": 882400,
      "text": "好吧啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 371,
      "start_ms": 882400,
      "end_ms": 885880,
      "text": "我觉得这是一个无可指摘的一个思路啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 372,
      "start_ms": 885880,
      "end_ms": 887560,
      "text": "但是我不是说我盒饭不做了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 373,
      "start_ms": 887560,
      "end_ms": 890580,
      "text": "我盒饭我平时包括说呃"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 374,
      "start_ms": 890580,
      "end_ms": 892920,
      "text": "我这个周六盒饭有明白吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 375,
      "start_ms": 892920,
      "end_ms": 895940,
      "text": "我就是说你这小朋友也知道我"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 376,
      "start_ms": 895940,
      "end_ms": 897920,
      "text": "我送我也会送送点饺子"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 377,
      "start_ms": 897920,
      "end_ms": 898700,
      "text": "你可以晚上吃"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 378,
      "start_ms": 898700,
      "end_ms": 899360,
      "text": "我送点饺子"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 379,
      "start_ms": 899360,
      "end_ms": 900920,
      "text": "过去送点我冻好的饺子"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 380,
      "start_ms": 900920,
      "end_ms": 902270,
      "text": "你晚上吃好嘞"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 381,
      "start_ms": 902270,
      "end_ms": 902930,
      "text": "对不对"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 382,
      "start_ms": 902930,
      "end_ms": 904400,
      "text": "盒饭中午给你吃一顿"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 383,
      "start_ms": 904400,
      "end_ms": 905480,
      "text": "对不对"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 384,
      "start_ms": 905480,
      "end_ms": 908880,
      "text": "唉啊我们实事求是讲实事求是讲好不好"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 385,
      "start_ms": 908880,
      "end_ms": 909520,
      "text": "来讲这边"
